    "turn_text": "Well, because I'm going back in about a week. But honestly, I mean, I decided to do this and I really wanted to do it here now that I'm thinking about it. I'm sitting on my mom's couch and all summer for the most part, I've been taking care of her. And I'm sitting on the couch where she sits for hours watching her masses and watching and doing her rosaries and all that. And I'm trying to feel my surroundings. And then she has like 20,000 photos around here, photos of you when you were little. And then we're going to talk about this situation, about immigration. And I think about all these people who want to have this and how unfair this is. It's just odd.",
