    "turn_text": "Well, you know that I phone-banked for you by way of powered by people. So I need no convincing on a personal level. And yet I have to say there's like this nagging question that's like eating at me that I imagine many people listening are thinking. And it's not one they want to ask. And it's not really one I want to ask. But I feel like I gotta, because we've done a good job here, I think, of trying to tell the truth. And the truth is whether it's the cruise loss in 2018, the Abbott loss in 2022. You mentioned Georgia or Stacey Abrams, who has come on this show, she lost in 2022 as well after having lost the last time in 2018 to Brian Kemp. And I just wonder, this optimism you hold Does hope you have in people? Has it not been shaken by these results, by these past elections?",
