        "text": "Language acquisition is essential for integration and survival in a new country.",
        "confidence": 0.96
      },
      {
        "text": "Immigration should require individuals to assimilate quickly upon arrival.",
        "confidence": 0.94
      },
      {
        "text": "Success after immigration depends primarily on individual effort rather than systemic support.",
        "confidence": 0.91
      },
      {
        "text": "The moral responsibility lies with immigrants to make use of opportunities once granted.",
        "confidence": 0.9
      },
      {
        "text": "Historical conditions in the 1960s were particularly hostile to newcomers without language skills.",
