    "turn_text": "It's Los Angeles. You have to, you have to value some time. But this is the thing to bring it full back. Like the generational divide is, yes, he came to this country the way so many people right now, as we are talking, are trying to come to this country. And at this very moment, we are not only making it difficult for them to come. We are punishing these people. We are physically abusing these people.",
