    "turn_idx": 99,
    "turn_text": "And I suppose the reason we wanted to make this episode to help tell the story about this moment is to remind people that maybe just see a fleeting headline or a bit on cable news that there is real pain and real lives that are being deeply, deeply affected in this moment. And all they want is a shot as your father, my grandfather, Sebastian, very much did.",
